    code_delta="Added scratchpad-shared/audio-port-64/ sources, scripts, runbook, and small verified binaries; updated REPO_LOCK.toml audio artifact hashes; removed accidentally tracked partial framework jar temp file.",
    verify="native_audiotest2_arm64 passes gate 3 (libmedia_jni dlopen) → gate 4 (register_MediaCodec_shim) → gate 5 (pthread detach) → gate 6 (OH_AudioStreamBuilder 440Hz tone) on 5583f5be and 5ce2dcee; toneplayer_arm64 also plays audible tone; gates 1-2 remain blocked by missing Java runtime.",
    note=".repo-skill/turns/2026-07-09-agent-audio-native-chain-verified.md"
  ];

